#X obj 250 819 cnv 1 515 1 empty empty empty 17 7 0 10 -216373 -1 0;
#X msg 130 819 @damping;
#X text 270 819 Controls damping of high frequencies as the delay decays.
0 is no damping \, 1 is very strong damping. Type: float. Default value:
0\. Range: [0\..0.99].;
#X obj 250 876 cnv 1 515 1 empty empty empty 17 7 0 10 -216373 -1 0;
#X msg 130 876 @delaytime;
#X text 270 876 Approximate delay time in seconds. Type: float. Units:
'sec'. Default value: 0.2\. Range: [0.001\..1.45].;
#X obj 250 918 cnv 1 515 1 empty empty empty 17 7 0 10 -216373 -1 0;
#X msg 130 918 @diffusion;
#X text 270 918 Shape of the diffusion unit. Values greater than 0.707
produce smooth exponential decay. Lower values produce a slower build-up
of echoes. Type: float. Default value: 0.5\. Range: [0\..0.99].;
#X obj 250 990 cnv 1 515 1 empty empty empty 17 7 0 10 -216373 -1 0;
#X msg 130 990 @drywet;
#X text 270 990 Proportion of mix between the original (dry) and processed
signals. 0 — dry signal \, 1 — processed. Type: float. Default value:
1\. Range: [0\..1].;
#X obj 250 1047 cnv 1 515 1 empty empty empty 17 7 0 10 -216373 -1 0;
#X msg 130 1047 @feedback;
#X text 270 1047 Amount of feedback for the delay line. Type: float.
